					<div id="ct_section_37_post_617" class="ct-section dark-section"><div class="ct-section-inner-wrap"><a id="ct_link_63_post_617" class="ct-link" href="https://toddlitton.com" target="_self"><img id="ct_image_35_post_617" alt="" src="https://toddlitton.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/Litton_MainLogo_lrg.png" class="ct-image"/></a><a id="ct_link_64_post_617" class="ct-link" href="https://toddlitton.com" target="_self"><img id="ct_image_62_post_617" alt="" src="https://toddlitton.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/01/Litton_TX.png" class="ct-image"/></a><svg id="ct_svg_icon_38_post_617" class="ct-Lineariconsicon-menu ct-svg-icon"><use xlink:href="#Lineariconsicon-menu"></use></svg><div id="ct_div_block_40_post_617" class="ct-div-block header-light-nav-container responsive-nav-target"><a id="ct_link_text_56_post_617" class="ct-link-text header-light-nav-link" href="https://toddlitton.com/about-todd/" target="_self">ABOUT TODD</a><a id="ct_link_text_42_post_617" class="ct-link-text header-light-nav-link" href="#" >VALUES</a><a id="ct_link_text_65_post_617" class="ct-link-text header-light-nav-link" href="https://toddlitton.com/endorsements/" target="_self">ENDORSEMENTS</a><a id="ct_link_text_43_post_617" class="ct-link-text header-light-nav-link" href="https://toddlitton.com/news/" target="_self">NEWS</a><a id="ct_link_text_60_post_617" class="ct-link-text header-light-nav-link" href="https://act.myngp.com/Forms/5413968932964797184" target="_blank">VOLUNTEER</a><a id="ct_link_text_46_post_617" class="ct-link-text " href="https://secure.actblue.com/contribute/page/todd-litton-for-congress-3" target="_self">DONATE</a><div id="ct_div_block_52_post_617" class="ct-div-block"><a id="ct_link_58_post_617" class="ct-link" href="https://twitter.com/toddlitton" target="_blank"><svg id="ct_svg_icon_53_post_617" class="ct-FontAwesomeicon-twitter ct-svg-icon"><use xlink:href="#FontAwesomeicon-twitter"></use></svg></a><a id="ct_link_59_post_617" class="ct-link" href="https://www.facebook.com/toddlittonforcongress/" target="_blank"><svg id="ct_svg_icon_54_post_617" class="ct-FontAwesomeicon-facebook ct-svg-icon"><use xlink:href="#FontAwesomeicon-facebook"></use></svg></a></div></div></div></div><div id="ct_section_525_post_310" class="ct-section"><div class="ct-section-inner-wrap"></div></div><div id="ct_section_570_post_310" class="ct-section"><div class="ct-section-inner-wrap"><div id="ct_div_block_571_post_310" class="ct-div-block"><div id="ct_text_block_572_post_310" class="ct-text-block">Join our block walk this weekend!</div><a id="ct_link_text_576_post_310" class="ct-link-text" href="https://act.myngp.com/Forms/-4814831720700441856" target="_self">SIGN UP</a></div></div></div><a id="ct_link_589_post_310" class="ct-link" href="https://secure.actblue.com/contribute/page/todd-litton-for-congress-3" target="_self"><div id="ct_section_583_post_310" class="ct-section"><div class="ct-section-inner-wrap"><div id="ct_text_block_584_post_310" class="ct-text-block"><div style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: inherit;">DONATE</span></div></div></div></div></a><a id="ct_link_582_post_310" class="ct-link" href="https://act.myngp.com/Forms/-4814831720700441856" target="_self"><div id="ct_section_579_post_310" class="ct-section"><div class="ct-section-inner-wrap"><div id="ct_text_block_580_post_310" class="ct-text-block">BLOCK WALK THIS WEEKEND</div></div></div></a><div id="ct_section_12_post_310" class="ct-section dark-section"><div class="ct-section-inner-wrap"><div id="ct_div_block_13_post_310" class="ct-div-block"><div id="ct_text_block_14_post_310" class="ct-text-block">support our campaign for</div><div id="ct_text_block_16_post_310" class="ct-text-block">COMMON SENSE <br><br><span id="ct_span_27_post_310" class="ct-span"><i>and</i></span> COMMON DECENCY</div><a id="ct_link_text_539_post_310" class="ct-link-text" href="https://act.myngp.com/Forms/5413968932964797184" target="_blank">CONNECT</a></div></div></div><img id="ct_image_606_post_310" alt="" src="https://toddlitton.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/01/mobileMainBanner.jpg" class="ct-image"/><div id="ct_section_601_post_310" class="ct-section"><div class="ct-section-inner-wrap"><div id="ct_div_block_602_post_310" class="ct-div-block"><img id="ct_image_603_post_310" alt="" src="https://toddlitton.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/01/TX02iconv2.png" class="ct-image"/></div></div></div><div id="ct_section_608_post_310" class="ct-section"><div class="ct-section-inner-wrap"><div id="ct_text_block_609_post_310" class="ct-text-block">IT'S TIME FOR SOME COMMON SENSE AND COMMON DECENCY IN WASHINGTON.</div><div id="ct_text_block_613_post_310" class="ct-text-block"><div style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: inherit;">It's time to send Democrat Todd Litton to Congress.</span></div></div><a id="ct_link_text_619_post_310" class="ct-link-text" href="https://toddlitton.com/about-todd/" target="_self">LEARN MORE</a><div id="ct_div_block_622_post_310" class="ct-div-block"></div></div></div><div id="ct_section_353_post_310" class="ct-section"><div class="ct-section-inner-wrap"><div id="ct_div_block_354_post_310" class="ct-div-block"><div id="ct_div_block_357_post_310" class="ct-div-block twin-image-content-section"><h1 id="ct_headline_358_post_310" class="ct-headline twin-image-content-section-headline"><div style="text-align: left;">THE TEXAS–02 DISTRICT</div></h1><h1 id="ct_headline_644_post_310" class="ct-headline twin-image-content-section-headline"><div style="text-align: center;">THE TEXAS–02 DISTRICT</div></h1><div id="ct_code_block_429_post_310" class="ct-code-block"><h2>A new vision for our district.</h2></div><div id="ct_paragraph_434_post_310" class="ct-paragraph"><p>Todd is a Democrat running to serve Texas's Second Congressional District (TX-02). It’s his conviction that everyone in our district deserves to have their representative hear their concerns, understand their dreams and goals for themselves and their families, and then work effectively to make those dreams and goals a reality.<br><br>He believes that Ted Poe and the Republican leadership have spent far too much time slicing and dicing our districts and highlighting our differences in an attempt to divide us with fear and doubt. We need a change.<br><br>Todd believes that using common sense and common decency – our heads and our hearts – we can find a way forward that respects and invests in all of our people and unlocks every person’s ability to contribute to our community’s and our country’s promise, progress, and prosperity.<br></p></div><div id="ct_paragraph_654_post_310" class="ct-paragraph"><p>Todd is a Democrat running to serve Texas's Second Congressional District (TX-02). It’s his conviction that everyone in our district deserves to have their representative hear their concerns, understand their dreams and goals for themselves and their families, and then work effectively to make those dreams and goals a reality. Using common sense and common decency – our heads and our hearts – we can find a way forward that respects and invests in all of our people and unlocks every person’s ability to contribute to our community’s and our country’s promise, progress, and prosperity.<br></p></div></div><div id="ct_div_block_355_post_310" class="ct-div-block twin-image-content-section"><a id="ct_link_423_post_310" class="ct-link" href="https://www.govtrack.us/congress/members/TX/2" target="_blank"><img id="ct_image_356_post_310" alt="" src="https://toddlitton.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/Texas02_Map-min.jpg" class="ct-image texas02map twin-image-content-section-image"/></a><a id="ct_link_text_419_post_310" class="ct-link-text" href="https://www.maptechnica.com/congressional-district-map/TX/02/4802" target="_blank">Click to view a detailed map of the district.</a></div></div></div></div><div id="ct_section_33_post_310" class="ct-section"><div class="ct-section-inner-wrap"><div id="ct_columns_41_post_310" class="ct-columns"><div class="ct-columns-inner-wrap"><div id="ct_column_42_post_310" class="ct-column"></div><div id="ct_column_43_post_310" class="ct-column"><div id="ct_text_block_45_post_310" class="ct-text-block"><div style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: inherit;">“I am running to serve in Congress because I </span><span style="font-family: inherit;">have a positive vision for our future based on my belief that what makes America truly exceptional is our people – <span id="ct_span_49_post_310" class="ct-span"><i>all of our people.</i></span>”</span></div></div></div><div id="ct_column_44_post_310" class="ct-column"></div></div></div></div></div><div id="ct_section_56_post_310" class="ct-section"><div class="ct-section-inner-wrap"><div id="ct_columns_57_post_310" class="ct-columns"><div class="ct-columns-inner-wrap"><div id="ct_column_58_post_310" class="ct-column"></div><div id="ct_column_59_post_310" class="ct-column"><img id="ct_image_544_post_310" alt="" src="https://toddlitton.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/12/Litton_Signature_Final_Web-min.png" class="ct-image"/></div><div id="ct_column_60_post_310" class="ct-column"></div></div></div></div></div><div id="ct_section_545_post_310" class="ct-section"><div class="ct-section-inner-wrap"><img id="ct_image_550_post_310" alt="" src="https://toddlitton.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/12/Litton_Signature_Final_Web-min.png" class="ct-image"/></div></div><div id="ct_section_517_post_310" class="ct-section"><div class="ct-section-inner-wrap"><div id="ct_div_block_518_post_310" class="ct-div-block"></div></div></div><div id="ct_section_649_post_310" class="ct-section"><div class="ct-section-inner-wrap"><img id="ct_image_651_post_310" alt="Todd Litton for Congress" src="https://toddlitton.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/05/family.jpg" class="ct-image"/></div></div><div id="ct_section_405_post_310" class="ct-section"><div class="ct-section-inner-wrap"><div id="ct_div_block_406_post_310" class="ct-div-block"><div id="ct_div_block_407_post_310" class="ct-div-block twin-image-content-section"><h1 id="ct_headline_408_post_310" class="ct-headline twin-image-content-section-headline">ABOUT TODD</h1><div id="ct_code_block_439_post_310" class="ct-code-block"><h2>A recognized leader in our community.</h2></div><div id="ct_paragraph_440_post_310" class="ct-paragraph"><p>Todd Litton has been leading and innovating in the education and nonprofit fields in the Houston area for the past 15 years. Todd’s work has focused on serving our region’s children and families, particularly in the “out-of-school” time areas of early childhood and afterschool that are a real struggle for families to find affordable, quality care for all of our children.<br></p></div><div id="ct_div_block_625_post_310" class="ct-div-block"><a id="ct_link_text_599_post_310" class="ct-link-text" href="https://toddlitton.com/about-todd/" target="_self">LEARN MORE</a></div></div><div id="ct_div_block_411_post_310" class="ct-div-block "><img id="ct_image_412_post_310" alt="" src="https://toddlitton.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/05/family-padding.jpg" class="ct-image twin-image-content-section-image"/></div></div></div></div><div id="ct_section_247_post_310" class="ct-section"><div class="ct-section-inner-wrap"><div id="ct_text_block_248_post_310" class="ct-text-block">Sign up for the latest news from the campaign.</div></div></div><div id="ct_section_251_post_310" class="ct-section dark-section"><div class="ct-section-inner-wrap"><div id="ct_div_block_252_post_310" class="ct-div-block footer-light-centered-menu"><img id="ct_image_303_post_310" alt="" src="https://toddlitton.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/Litton_altLogo_lrg.png" class="ct-image"/></div><div id="ct_text_block_259_post_310" class="ct-text-block"><span id="ct-placeholder-276"></span></div><div id="ct_div_block_260_post_310" class="ct-div-block"><a id="ct_link_261_post_310" class="ct-link lower-footer-centered-icon-link" href="https://twitter.com/toddlitton" target="_blank"><svg id="ct_svg_icon_280_post_310" class="ct-FontAwesomeicon-twitter ct-svg-icon"><use xlink:href="#FontAwesomeicon-twitter"></use></svg></a><a id="ct_link_293_post_310" class="ct-link" href="https://www.facebook.com/toddlittonforcongress/" target="_blank"><svg id="ct_svg_icon_294_post_310" class="ct-FontAwesomeicon-facebook ct-svg-icon"><use xlink:href="#FontAwesomeicon-facebook"></use></svg></a></div><div id="ct_div_block_12_post_765" class="ct-div-block"><div id="ct_text_block_14_post_765" class="ct-text-block">PAID FOR BY TODD LITTON FOR CONGRESS</div></div></div></div><div id="ct_text_block_304_post_310" class="ct-text-block"><div style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: inherit;">INFO@TODDLITTON.COM   |   P.O. BOX 980874   |   HOUSTON, TX 77098</span></div></div><div id="ct_text_block_505_post_310" class="ct-text-block"><div style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: inherit;">INFO@TODDLITTON.COM</span></div><div style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: inherit;">P.O. BOX 980874</span></div><div style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: inherit;">HOUSTON, TX 77098</span></div></div>			<script type="text/javascript" id="ct_custom_js_37">jQuery(function($) {
